# Saved states from the gap assay and the emergence sweeps. Same rationale as docs/runs/states above:
# binary, regenerable from the harness + seed, and they accumulate fast (314 files / 6.7 MB by
# 2026-09-07). Regenerability is demonstrated, not assumed: re-running seed 509 reproduced its vesicle
# at the same step.
#
# docs/controls/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The certified emergent vesicle lives there and must be
# tracked: this project has already destroyed one irreplaceable vesicle by letting a relaunch
# overwrite it in place (states_protected/former_sd45007_*, filename says step 960,000, file reports
# 1,600,000).
